  "decision": "The entire one-file hunk scopes the modern mat-mdc snack action button-color token to mat-unthemed, preventing that structural modern rule from overriding explicitly themed current buttons. It does not edit a legacy theme mixin. Keep the original16 legacy action/primary/accent/warn behavior; do not transplant this modern structural selector into the owned legacy Sass. Both exact peer npm floors already contain the modern structural selector; their component internals are not copied. The retained historical ordinary snack-bar-theme emits theme token values and does not embed this structural container rule. The actual original16-versus-packed style probes pass default and custom snack-container, action, and explicit primary action properties. This is a do-not-adopt decision for the add-on, not a claim to have executed or certified every current modern snack-bar interaction.",
